• On phones and small tablets, default to taps and ordinary content scrolling. Do not require multiple screen heights of scrolling, pinned scenes, scroll scrubbing, scroll-jacking, autoplay tours, or repeated transitions before visitors can reach useful content. Desktop cinematic scrolling does not imply permission to copy it onto mobile.

