• Use a clear main heading and a logical heading structure. Write natural, useful copy around the business's actual offering and location; do not stuff keywords or create repetitive city lists, doorway pages, fabricated testimonials, awards or experience claims.

• Keep essential information equivalent on mobile and desktop.
Provide accessible, understandable controls for revealed sections, with correct focus handling and inactive-state behavior. Do not confuse visually hidden state with content that has not been loaded at all.
Use real anchor links and verified destinations. Same-page anchors may select sections, but are not independently indexable property/service pages. Do not claim that each room, tab or hash address can rank as a separate page. Preserve the single-homepage scope: do not create extra pages or expand the sitemap without explicit authorization.
